BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Delegation of Authority and Approval Matrix) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-FIN-003 | Owner: Group Finance | Effective date: 1 April 2024 | Version: 1) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 676 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 654 Td (This policy sets out who may commit Meridian Instruments Ltd and its subsidiaries to spending,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (contracts and capital investment, and up to what value. It ensures that significant decisions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (receive the right level of scrutiny, and that no single person can both initiate and approve a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (commitment.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 590 Td (2. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 568 Td (The matrix applies to all Meridian entities: Meridian Instruments Ltd \(Leeds\), Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 555 Td (Instruments B.V. \(Rotterdam\), Meridian Instruments Inc. \(Austin\) and Meridian Instruments Sdn.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542 Td (Bhd. \(Penang\). It covers operating expenditure, purchase requisitions, capital expenditure,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 529 Td (contracts and write-offs. Employee travel and expense claims are approved under the Travel and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 516 Td (Expense Policy \(POL-FIN-007\), and corporate card spend under the Corporate Card Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 503 Td (\(POL-FIN-009\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 478 Td (3. Principles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 456 Td (- Approval limits apply to the total value of the commitment over its full life, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 443 Td (   all years of a multi-year contract, excluding VAT or sales tax.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 430 Td (- Commitments must not be split to fall under a lower approval limit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 417 Td (- An approver may not approve a commitment from which they personally benefit, or one they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 404 Td (   have raised themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 391 Td (- Approvers may only approve spend against cost centres for which they are responsible, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 378 Td (   higher-level approvers above them in the hierarchy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 365 Td (- Delegation of an approval limit during absence must be recorded in Atlas and may only be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 352 Td (   made to someone at the same level or above.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 336 Td (4. Operating expenditure and purchase requisitions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 314 Td (Purchase requisitions are raised and approved in Atlas under Atlas > Procurement > Purchase) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 301 Td (Requisition. Approval routes automatically by value.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 280 Td (Commitment value | Approver) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 268 Td (Up to \2435,000 | Budget holder) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 256 Td (\2435,000.01 to \24325,000 | Head of Department) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 244 Td (\24325,000.01 to \243100,000 | Finance Director) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 232 Td (\243100,000.01 to \243500,000 | CFO) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 220 Td (\243500,000.01 to \2431,000,000 | CEO) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 208 Td (Above \2431,000,000 | Board of Directors) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 186 Td (Each level also requires the approval of the levels below it: for example, a \24360,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 173 Td (requisition is approved by the budget holder, the Head of Department and the Finance Director.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 160 Td (Quotation and tender requirements are set out separately in the Procurement Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 147 Td (\(POL-FIN-012\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 122 Td (5. Capital expenditure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 100 Td (All capital expenditure over \2431,000 must be submitted on a Capital Expenditure Request \(F-420\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 87 Td (with a business case, even where it is within the annual capital budget. Items below \2431,000 are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 74 Td (expensed.) Tj ET
