BT /F1 10 Tf 54 383 Td (Limits are expressed in pounds sterling. For commitments in other currencies, the value is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 370 Td (converted at the Group budget exchange rate for the financial year. For FY2024/25 the budget) Tj ET
